# Zork I in Tara McGrew's 2025 Inform port, played through to 350
# points along the same walkthrough as the Z-Machine script for
# release 88. The port's parser and map differ in a few places, which
# the commands below allow for. The seed matters more than usual:
# under some seeds this port stops with a fatal error of its own on
# re-entering the Squeaky Room after the torch is dropped there, which
# Glulxe reports at the same line, so it is the game's and not the
# interpreter's.
! SEED=10
! GAME=../entharion/glulx-code/zork1-r1-s251203.ulx

n. n. u
get egg
d. s. e
open window
w
get all
w
open sack
get lunch and garlic
drop all
get sword and lamp
move rug
open trapdoor
open case
e. u
turn on lamp
get all
d. w
drop knife
d. s. e
get painting
w. n. n

# The battle with the troll is random. Under this
# script's seed he falls to the second blow, and so
# does the thief later on, with no damage taken.

kill troll
kill troll
kill troll

drop sword
e. e. se. e
tie rope to railing
d. s. e
get coffin
w. s
pray
s. n. w. w. w
open coffin
get sceptre
put coffin and painting in case
e. e. e. e. d. d. n
wave sceptre
e. e. n. n
get shovel
ne
dig sand
again. again. again
drop shovel
get scarab
sw. s. s. w. w
get pot
sw. u. u. nw. w. w. w
put all but lamp in case
get all but sack and garlic
open trapdoor
d. n. w. s. e. u
get bag and key
sw. e. s. se
give lunch and water to cyclops

# Now we come to the thief. This port's parser wants
# the knife named, and under this seed two blows do.

u
give egg to thief
kill thief with knife
kill thief with knife

get all but stiletto
drop knife
d. nw. s. w. u. d. ne
unlock grate
drop key
open grate
u. s.

# This is the part where it was crucial to give
# the egg to the thief because he opened it so
# you could get at the canary.
wind up canary

get bauble
s. e. w. w
get canary
put all but lamp in case
get garlic

d. n. e. n. ne. e. n
get matchbook
e
push yellow
get wrench and screwdriver
w. s
drop garlic and screwdriver
turn bolt with wrench
drop wrench
e
get plastic
n
drop plastic
s. sw. s. e
echo
get bar
w. se. e. d
turn off lamp
get torch
s
get bell
s
get all
d. d
ring bell
get candles
light match
light candles
read book
s
get skull

n. u. n. n. n. w. w. s. u
put skull and bar in case
d. n. e. n. ne. e
get garlic and screwdriver
w. n
drop all but torch. get trunk
n. n
get trident
s. s. s. sw. sw. w. s. u
put trunk and trident in case

d. n. e. n. ne. n
get all
n. n. u. n. n. w. n. w
drop torch
turn on lamp
n
get figurine
s
drop figurine
n. e
drop all but lamp and garlic
n. d. e. ne. se. sw. d. d. s
get coal
n. u. u. n. e. s. n. u. s
get all
put coal and screwdriver in basket
light match
light candles with match
put candles in basket
lower basket
drop matchbook
n. d. e. ne. se. sw. d. d. w
drop all
w
get coal and candles and screwdriver
s
open lid
put coal in machine
close lid
turn switch with screwdriver
drop screwdriver
open lid
get diamond
n
put diamond in basket
drop candles
e
get lantern and garlic and book
e. u. u. n. e. s. n
get sapphire
u. s
raise basket
get diamond
w. s
get all

e. s. d. u
drop garlic
put all but lamp in case
d. n. e. n. ne. n. n
get pump
s. s. e
get plastic
s. d. e. e. s
drop plastic
pump up plastic
drop pump
enter boat
launch
get buoy
land
get out of boat
s. w. w. sw. u. u. nw. w. w. w
open buoy
put emerald in case
e. e. n. w. sw. w
quit
